      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My logs of playing a video, which I was unable to hear: https://pastebin.com/qW2ruG81\nI'm wondering if the issue of people being unable to hear or see video players could be because the video player isn't properly recognizing their headset/headphones or something. In my logs it says that it's using my \"Valve VR Radio & HMD Mic\" even though I'm on desktop and using separate headphones. This could be why the issue only happens on desktop but works fine when I have my Index on in VR. Maybe something similar is happening to the people in VR who can't see/hear because of their multiple audio sources?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
