      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay, I figured out why only some youtube videos play while other videos don't, and why Karaoke Central is broken. If you try and play anything that has some kind of copyright on it (like all of the music in the karaoke map for example), it will not work. \nEvery video that does not have any kind of copyright claim will work though. I remember this bug happening once before with youtube-dl a long time ago.\nThis is only for VRC_SyncVideoPlayer though, VRC_SyncStreamPlayer you can still play anything.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
